MPS third-party source notice

Date: 2026-11-14. Driver version: 0.1.0.

Source inventory:

* MPS/MPI wire definitions and MPSDmaSgl.h SAS2 format: FreeBSD
  reference/freebsd/sys/dev/mps/mpi/{mpi2.h,mpi2_ioc.h,mpi2_cnfg.h,
  mpi2_init.h,mpi2_sas.h,mpi2_tool.h}; LSI/Avago BSD-2-Clause terms below.
* Controller/discovery/WarpDrive behavior and PCI identifiers: FreeBSD
  reference/freebsd/sys/dev/mps/{mps.c,mps_pci.c,mps_config.c,mps_sas.c,
  mps_sas_lsi.c,mps_mapping.c,mps_user.c,mpsvar.h,mps_ioctl.h}.
* macOS IOKit controller, block-device, async, target and native management
  glue: adapted from the adjacent MPR 0.24.0 source. Its existing transcribed
  MPI definitions carry Broadcom's three-clause terms, retained below and in
  the adapted files. No MPR hardware result is transferred to MPS.
* Linux reference/linux/drivers/scsi/mpt3sas is GPL-2.0 behavior/protocol
  reference only. No Linux implementation code is incorporated into the kext.
* MacKernelSDK is a separate compilation dependency under its existing notices.
  No Apple kernel implementation is copied into this driver.

Acquisition metadata for the local reference trees is retained with the survey
under _scratch/lsi2308. reference/ is read-only and not part of the build.
